WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.405
A view can reduce accidental exposure by publishing
only the columns required for an analytical

00:00:05.432 --> 00:00:11.138
task For example an analytics interface may expose
an age band

00:00:11.164 --> 00:00:16.701
and city instead of direct contact fields But hiding
columns in a view

00:00:16.715 --> 00:00:22.256
definition is not the same as granting or denying
access Actual

00:00:22.282 --> 00:00:27.822
authorization depends on PostgreSQL privileges and
where appropriate row-level security or

00:00:27.835 --> 00:00:28.716
other controls
